    <p class="statement">The loops you learned early tend to run your love life, your friendships and your work. <em>Change them once, and they change everywhere.</em></p>
    <p class="soft">Red Thread Labs LLC is a Salt Lake City-based organization that helps people build long-lasting, authentic relationship skills. We find the patterns, test and practice new skills, and actually shift behavior using evidence-based methods. Our goal is to help people across the country build skills that allow them to relate and connect with others more effectively.</p>
